{"4038160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FPV Labs - Drone Simulator", "steam_appid": 4038160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FPV Labs is built around one idea: Transfer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Hours in the simulator should improve your real flights.</i><br><br><br>We’re a two-person team of FPV pilots who fly every week.    <br>We didn’t want another arcade drone game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We wanted a simulator that truly feels like flying a real drone in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So we started building FPV Labs.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FPV Labs is your virtual spot, your training ground, and the place where simulator time actually counts.</strong>   <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/3ee26aff74e124084f8206101032e45e.poster.avif?t=1779918591\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/3ee26aff74e124084f8206101032e45e.webm?t=1779918591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/3ee26aff74e124084f8206101032e45e.mp4?t=1779918591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Most Detailed Drone Configurator in Any FPV Sim</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aspect that affects your quad’s flight behavior can be adjusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame size. Motor KV. Prop size. Weight. Camera angle. PID tuning. Rates. <br><strong> </strong>Dial in your exact real-life setup or experiment with builds you’ve never tried before. <br> <br><strong>Just want to fly?</strong> <br>Pick one of the included ready-to-fly presets and hit the throttle. <br> <br>Want to go deep? Fine-tune every detail until it behaves exactly like your real quad. <br>The configurator is there when you want it and invisible when you don’t.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Build, save, and switch between unlimited drone presets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust physics parameters in real time. Even mid-flight.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share your setups with the community through Community Presets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive UI designed for pilots, not engineers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/559153d139f79c9cc73ae4822d2e4602.poster.avif?t=1779918591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/559153d139f79c9cc73ae4822d2e4602.webm?t=1779918591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/559153d139f79c9cc73ae4822d2e4602.mp4?t=1779918591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community Presets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found the perfect setup? Share it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for something new? Download it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community Presets let you exchange drone configurations with one click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try builds from experienced freestyle pilots.<br>Load a beginner-friendly setup.<br>Share your competition configuration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> <br><i>FPV Labs grows with its pilots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics That Feel Right</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the very beginning, our goal was to create a simulator that doesn't just look good,  but feels right. </strong><br><strong>Every flight should bring the same intensity as flying your real quad at a real spot. </strong><br> <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/975de6a71f5351e634e20051fef0ba3f.poster.avif?t=1779918591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/975de6a71f5351e634e20051fef0ba3f.webm?t=1779918591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/975de6a71f5351e634e20051fef0ba3f.mp4?t=1779918591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real PID controller system – sharp, responsive, true to life</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accurate propwash and turbulence simulation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic crash and impact behavior</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wind simulation that affects your lines</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foliage collision – trees and bushes react to your quad </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>All of this is built around one idea: Transfer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Time in the simulator should improve your real flights.</i><strong> </strong> <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handcrafted Maps Inspired by Real FPV Spots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map captures the atmosphere of a real FPV spot. Handcrafted, packed with lines, gaps, and freestyle opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two maps at Early Access launch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chemical Plant Bando</strong>  <br>An abandoned industrial environment packed with tight gaps, massive buildings, and freestyle flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/22b1833357d540757cb4e0d25778c55b.avif?t=1779918591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras_big/22b1833357d540757cb4e0d25778c55b.avif?t=1779918591 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costa Roja</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fictional coastal region inspired by the Canary Islands, featuring abandoned ruins, rugged mountains and vast pine forests. Perfect for freestyle, long range and cinematic flights<strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/397e92f3da72c14a878ddb271bc87884.avif?t=1779918591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras_big/397e92f3da72c14a878ddb271bc87884.avif?t=1779918591 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps are planned after release, shaped by what the community wants to fly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038160/extras/f8bd13f6071e397f57919626b56b8619.poster.avif?t=1779918591\"